{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/465579-how-aware-are-demons-of-when-their-cover-is-eroding","id":465579,"title":"How aware are demons of when their cover is eroding?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-01T20:57:40-07:00","id":465579,"title":"How aware are demons of when their cover is eroding?","content":"Or rather would they notice if it wasn't when it should be? Do they know implicitly that someone questions? even if it doesn't cause a glitch?<br /> <br /> I'm planning on taking my players to an Infrastructure facility that is still operational but no longer under the care of the Machines agents. Inside of it there is a device that repel's the &quot;mask&quot; over humanities eyes. In other words one's full demonic form would be be expose, vampire's look like the walking dead no matter how much blood they pump, faeries have no masque in it's presence, etc. No one within it's sphere of influence (depending upon how it's configured) thinks that what they're seeing is abnormal. What I'm wondering is whether a Demon would notice that he's not sending up flairs for wandering around in demonic form (note: this doesn't mean that a Hunter angel wouldn't attack on sight)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":4046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","user":"xenoterracide","date":". 04-02-2015, 12:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-01T23:03:16-07:00","id":465696,"title":"","content":"Very aware.<br /> <br /> The rules state (cannot find where) that the demon is always aware of a compromise (not necessarily the source).<br /> <br /> Consider your awareness of whether or not you're hungry right now, or that you need to breath. You may not be constantly thinking about it, but you always have access to that information.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-01T23:53:12-07:00","id":465736,"title":"","content":"So what's the style of reveal on this thing? I mean is this going to be functioning like true sight in DND where all the things are still actually in place it just doesn't look like it, or is this like a forced reversion to one's true form?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T06:40:30-07:00","id":466015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/465579-how-aware-are-demons-of-when-their-cover-is-eroding?p=465736#post465736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what's the style of reveal on this thing? I mean is this going to be functioning like true sight in DND where all the things are still actually in place it just doesn't look like it, or is this like a forced reversion to one's true form?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think more like true sight. My current thought is it's actually part of the concealment infrastructure that keeps humanity blind, but it has currently had it's behavior tweaked, and it could be tweaked further.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T07:33:43-07:00","id":467358,"title":"","content":"I'm not really sure where the comparison to true sight is coming from. An eroding cover is primarily internal. You can't remember your Cover's birthday, or her friends and family. Her closet becomes drab and unremarkable, her neighbors forget her, and the people that should know her have trouble remembering anything notable she's done. <br /> <br /> True sight lets you see invisible, ethereal, and shapeshifted creatures, none of which apply here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T07:40:32-07:00","id":467377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/465579-how-aware-are-demons-of-when-their-cover-is-eroding?p=467358#post467358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not really sure where the comparison to true sight is coming from. An eroding cover is primarily internal. You can't remember your Cover's birthday, or her friends and family. Her closet becomes drab and unremarkable, her neighbors forget her, and the people that should know her have trouble remembering anything notable she's done.<br /> <br /> True sight lets you see invisible, ethereal, and shapeshifted creatures, none of which apply here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Reading the whole OP would help your confusion immensely:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I'm planning on taking my players to an Infrastructure facility that is still operational but no longer under the care of the Machines agents. Inside of it there is a device that repel's the &quot;mask&quot; over humanities eyes. In other words one's full demonic form would be be expose, vampire's look like the walking dead no matter how much blood they pump, faeries have no masque in it's presence, etc. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T08:04:04-07:00","id":467396,"title":"","content":"Which doesn't seem to have anything to do with eroding a cover. This and that are separate issues. I don't understand how they're connected.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T10:14:59-07:00","id":467552,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/465579-how-aware-are-demons-of-when-their-cover-is-eroding#post465579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What I'm wondering is whether a Demon would notice that he's not sending up flairs for wandering around in demonic form (note: this doesn't mean that a Hunter angel wouldn't attack on sight)</div> </div> </div> </div>The OP is asking whether or not they'd notice that they aren't getting Compromises while in the field.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T11:05:59-07:00","id":467623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/465579-how-aware-are-demons-of-when-their-cover-is-eroding?p=467358#post467358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not really sure where the comparison to true sight is coming from. An eroding cover is primarily internal. You can't remember your Cover's birthday, or her friends and family. Her closet becomes drab and unremarkable, her neighbors forget her, and the people that should know her have trouble remembering anything notable she's done.<br /> <br /> True sight lets you see invisible, ethereal, and shapeshifted creatures, none of which apply here.</div> </div> </div> </div>The True sight comparison was a question of how this thing was going to be working. The question was, is this a situation where everyone is actually stripped of their disguises? Because if that was the case then all the demonic form attributes come into play. If this is an area wherein basically everyone has true sight then it means everyone is seeing the demon's true form, but the demon is technically in his cover form and therefore has to go through the normal processes if any of the demonic form abilities are desired.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T12:46:34-07:00","id":467789,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/465579-how-aware-are-demons-of-when-their-cover-is-eroding?p=467623#post467623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The True sight comparison was a question of how this thing was going to be working. The question was, is this a situation where everyone is actually stripped of their disguises? Because if that was the case then all the demonic form attributes come into play. If this is an area wherein basically everyone has true sight then it means everyone is seeing the demon's true form, but the demon is technically in his cover form and therefore has to go through the normal processes if any of the demonic form abilities are desired.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> honestly I hadn't considered that, which is why I started asking questions in the first place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T17:34:15-07:00","id":468020,"title":"","content":"Ah, I think I see now, Nalak. Thanks.<br /> <br /> <br /> If we're going with &quot;seeing true form&quot; bit, wouldn't that include seeing every one of the demon's Covers at the same time as well? They exist at the same time in a kind of quantum flux equally along side the demon form, so you shouldn't see more than just the Demon Form?<br /> <br /> <br /> And what about Spoofing? Will a demon be able to spoof the effect, since its exactly the kind of thing that ability was designed for?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T18:08:02-07:00","id":468051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/465579-how-aware-are-demons-of-when-their-cover-is-eroding?p=468020#post468020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, I think I see now, Nalak. Thanks.<br /> <br /> <br /> If we're going with &quot;seeing true form&quot; bit, wouldn't that include seeing every one of the demon's Covers at the same time as well? They exist at the same time in a kind of quantum flux equally along side the demon form, so you shouldn't see more than just the Demon Form?<br /> <br /> <br /> And what about Spoofing? Will a demon be able to spoof the effect, since its exactly the kind of thing that ability was designed for?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know about spoofing (I'd need to reread the rules there to get a feel), but the idea of a demon with more than one cover showing up as a kind of instability thing where anyone looking is seeing all the covers and the demon form simultaneously overlapping in a kind of headache inducing mishmash would be amusing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T06:24:10-07:00","id":470087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/465579-how-aware-are-demons-of-when-their-cover-is-eroding#post465579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or rather would they notice if it wasn't when it should be? Do they know implicitly that someone questions? even if it doesn't cause a glitch?<br /> <br /> I'm planning on taking my players to an Infrastructure facility that is still operational but no longer under the care of the Machines agents. Inside of it there is a device that repel's the &quot;mask&quot; over humanities eyes. In other words one's full demonic form would be be expose, vampire's look like the walking dead no matter how much blood they pump, faeries have no masque in it's presence, etc. No one within it's sphere of influence (depending upon how it's configured) thinks that what they're seeing is abnormal. What I'm wondering is whether a Demon would notice that he's not sending up flairs for wandering around in demonic form (note: this doesn't mean that a Hunter angel wouldn't attack on sight)</div> </div> </div> </div>Instantly aware. Very aware.<br /> <br /> I actually don't think such goggles would work on Changelings (simply because the theme is &quot;abuse victims hiding all the time&quot;) or Demons. Definitely not Demons, when they're not in demonic form the demonic form is literally <i>not even there</i> to be sensed or revealed. It'd be like checking the contents of the box to see if the cat is alive or dead, but the cover is the wrong box - the cover <b>is </b>the demon's &quot;true form&quot; at the moment, and all that this implies. Changing into demonic form is grafting things that don't exist in the same time or place into the same time and place. It ought to at least allow spoofing if it works at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T11:25:18-07:00","id":470282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>raygungoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/465579-how-aware-are-demons-of-when-their-cover-is-eroding?p=470087#post470087\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Instantly aware. Very aware.<br /> <br /> I actually don't think such goggles would work on Changelings (simply because the theme is &quot;abuse victims hiding all the time&quot;) or Demons. Definitely not Demons, when they're not in demonic form the demonic form is literally <i>not even there</i> to be sensed or revealed. It'd be like checking the contents of the box to see if the cat is alive or dead, but the cover is the wrong box - the cover <b>is </b>the demon's &quot;true form&quot; at the moment, and all that this implies. Changing into demonic form is grafting things that don't exist in the same time or place into the same time and place. It ought to at least allow spoofing if it works at all.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just as an aside, I don't see that as a terribly accurate description of Changeling. Many/most Changelings are survivors who have moved on past abuse, and some were never really abused at all, admittedly a low number with non-Loyalists. While hiding is big for the Winter Court, other Courts have very different approaches. So that really strikes me as rather inaccurate.<br /> <br /> That said, I do agree given the nature of the Mask and source of powers having it reveal the Mien seems unlikely.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T14:47:35-07:00","id":470395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baron Samedi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/465579-how-aware-are-demons-of-when-their-cover-is-eroding?p=470282#post470282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Just as an aside, I don't see that as a terribly accurate description of Changeling. Many/most Changelings are survivors who have moved on past abuse, and some were never really abused at all, admittedly a low number with non-Loyalists. While hiding is big for the Winter Court, other Courts have very different approaches. So that really strikes me as rather inaccurate.<br /> <br /> That said, I do agree given the nature of the Mask and source of powers having it reveal the Mien seems unlikely.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're right, of course - but my issues with Changeling as a game runs deeper than that (The baseline Court System, ugh: first time they escape their abuse, rather than &quot;put it past them&quot; they reconstruct a society that essentially punishes the abused and rewards abusers).<br /> <br /> Anyway, when I say &quot;hiding,&quot; I mean, &quot;the magic pretty much auto-hides you.&quot; It's not like obfuscate where they're doing something active, the Mask just goes up and sticks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T16:22:15-07:00","id":470452,"title":"","content":"I strongly disagree with that...but I am going to drop it as it is way off subject.<br /> <br /> For the record I am not dropping due to any disdain of you or to imply anything bad, just cuz we are far afield.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1